  "notes": [
    {
      "week": 1,
      "emoji": "🎀",
      "title": "National Princess Day",
      "message": "I wanted to make a special place where you could look back years from now at all the memories we shared together. Every week I'll add new notes of the experiences we shared together, special moments, or the wonderful things you made me feel. I'll also update the website throughout our time together to add more features, outfits, and collectibles for you to explore. Every success I have in my life is genuinely because of you. I'm motivated to be a better man everyday so I can serve you to the best of my ability. Thank you my princess for choosing to be my girl. I promise I'll spend the rest of my life in service of my goddess. AKA my pretty little dictator. 🎀",
      "published": true
    },
    {
      "week": 2,
      "emoji": "🌷",
      "title": "Gaming with da pookies",
      "message": "I wanted to first off say that I know I can be a real idiot sometimes. And yes by sometimes I mean all the times my princess; I honestly genuinely love playing games with you. It's one of my favorite parts of our relationship: being able to get on a game and yap about anything our minds wander off to. It truly made my whole day not only playing roblox with you, but also having fun alongside you and your friends in hunting for the pirate token. I feel so adored and accepted by you and I am so honored everyday you provide me the privilege of playing games with you and even trusting me not to bark in front of your friends. Thank you my princess for dealing with an idiot like me because this idiot really fell hard for the most beautiful girl in the world (I'm taking about you obviously lol). I love you my pretty little dictator; I promise to always cherish these little moments with have together. Also I LOVE OUR MATCHING ROBLOX OUTFITS SO MUCH <3. I actually looked at the store the following day to think of potential outfits idea I love matching with you so much. And the way you command me to match with you 😳... you literally have me wrapped around your fingers.",
      "published": true,
      "image": "week2actualmain.png",
      "imageAlt": "If the image doesn't load it is us playing roblox together <3"
    },
